t(57, 1485, """The West invented elections and marketed them to mankind as the only correct way for states to arise, to be governed and to flourish .. This is a Western invention .. The West thinks Allah created the world to be Western! The West thinks the world must be Western .. that the world must follow the Western method! That the world must embrace Western thought! That the world must believe the Western mind is the mind that must be followed! The truth is that the West itself will one day wake up to a shock that will make it itself reject elections and the way of establishing states by electing the ruler, king or emperor .. The Western marketing of Western ideas as a complete, correct and sound package for building humanity is about to collapse .. to retreat .. to fall back and then vanish!""")

t(57, 2175, """A law reuniting children with divorced fathers and mothers is a humane law not applied in the whole world, where the laws leave one parent free to decide the other party's fate by depriving them of the child, and legislation and laws do not intervene to protect the child humanly and psychologically, because of the obstinacy of fathers and mothers to a greater degree than the effect of other circumstances, whether geographic or economic. There are millions of children deprived of their mothers or deprived of their fathers! There are millions of mothers deprived of their children and millions of fathers deprived of their children!""")

t(58, 1300, """Pour the tea, my son .. pour .. Every era has its taxes .. We thought they were only beautiful cities, and we thought it was only everything beautiful, and no hard laws .. We did not know there is a great tax for justice on earth .. We did not know the tax of justice is this hard .. We thought we would live as we were used to .. do everything we used to do .. live only to have fun and rejoice .. We did not know the new era would change everything .. Public life in it will be this strict .. disciplined .. We were not used to that .. Would that we had died before this .. Pour, my son""")

t(59, 430, """Many roles in life may die, but the role of this strategic man may not die .. No society is safe without his role!""")

t(59, 1905, """Artificial intelligence was asked a question, the reason being that I saw with my own eyes that the streets of India, Sri Lanka, Malaysia and Indonesia inside the neighbourhoods, between the houses, are made of cement and not asphalt. I also noticed that most street pavements in Kuala Lumpur, the capital of Malaysia, are not of stone but of cement, and rain falls on them daily!! The artificial intelligence gave an answer I did not expect!

Can a road paved with "cement only" withstand rain .. Cement only, meaning with no other materials added to the cement.

It answered: Yes, a road paved with cement (concrete) can withstand rain; indeed it is considered more durable and more resistant to weather and heavy rain compared with asphalt roads.
Here are the details on the ability of cement roads to withstand rain:

High durability: concrete roads are hard and strong enough to withstand harsh climatic conditions, including heavy rainfall and snow, without their structure being quickly affected.""")

t(60, 60, """Resistance to potholes: unlike asphalt, which may crack and form potholes as a result of water seeping into it, cement roads stay intact and are not affected by water to the same degree.
Long service life: these roads usually last between 30 and 40 years, a much longer period than the life of asphalt roads.
The effect of rain during construction:
After hardening: rain does not harm concrete after it has dried and hardened; indeed water can act as a "curing agent" that increases its strength.
During pouring: if rain falls during the pouring of cement, it may weaken the top surface or raise the proportion of water in the mix, which requires protecting it with plastic covers until it hardens.""")

t(60, 1945, """Dear brother followers.. Please do not post your dreams in the comments, because it will turn into replies, a thousand opinions, and time and effort consumed, and the matter will become like a racetrack, and that is exhausting. May Allah protect you all""")

